```{list-table} DocumentReference
:name: RBDCA_DocumentReference
:width: 100%
:header-rows: 1

* - Column name
  - Data type
  - Definition

* - referenceCode 
  - WISEIdentifier - varchar(42) 
  - Max length: 42 characters.<br>Required.<br>Unique identifier of the reference to a document.<br>WISE identifiers must start with the two-letter country code of the Member State, followed by one character that can be a digit or an uppercase letter, followed by a sequence of characters (0 to 38 characters long) that can be digits or uppercase letters, with no consecutive double hyphens or double underscores, but allowing for single hyphens or underscores between characters. The code can optionally end with one character that can be a digit or an uppercase letter.<br>Examples: FR123, FR1_XYZ1234_1, FR1-XYZ1234-1, FR1XYZ12341 but not FR1__XYZ1234__1 or FRa123. 

* - documentCode 
  - Document 
  - Required.<br>Link to the document the reference belongs to. 

* - bookmark 
  - nvarchar(250) 
  - Max length: 250 characters.<br>Required.<br>Bookmark within the document. 

* - subject 
  - nvarchar(250) 
  - Max length: 250 characters.<br>Required.<br>Subject of the reference. 
